by Kocal at 2026-09-01T13:17:34Z

Oh, it looks like that some UX Toolkit snapshots are impacted.
Well it's fine, it means that we actually found and fixed more issues.

The following example:
```twig
<twig:Navbar :background="null" theme="light" style="background-color: #e3f2fd;">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <a class="navbar-brand" href="#">Navbar</a>
        <div class="navbar-nav flex-row gap-3">
            <a class="nav-link active" aria-current="page" href="#">Home</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#">Features</a>
            <a class="nav-link" href="#">Pricing</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</twig:Navbar>
```

with an explicit `:background="null"`, should have never been rendered like:
```html
<nav class="navbar bg-body-tertiary" data-bs-theme="light" style="background-color: #e3f2fd;">
```

but like that instead:
```html
<nav class="navbar" data-bs-theme="light" style="background-color: #e3f2fd;">
```

